{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38488","headline":"南迁途中作七首 登七盘岭二首 二 · 吴融","name":"南迁途中作七首 登七盘岭二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"七盘岭上一长号，将谓青天鉴郁陶。\n近日青天都不鉴，七盘应是未高高。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38488.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38488","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}